  "description": "NEGATIVE CONTROL for props_pickup_placement_corpus_negative (PL.native-pickup-settle): a deliberately WRONG copy of core's conformance/props/pickup-placement.json. Its numerics names float32, contract.frames.unreal and contract.constants.spacingM are wrong, no case drives the ring op, and four cases expect WRONG answers. The runner must report every one of them and fail.",
